Docker cluster nodes (VMs)
--------------------------
VirtualBox (Intel)
-------------------
$ cd /opt/kickstart-linux
$ VAGRANT_CWD=./vagrant/alma-linux-9/virtualbox/amd64/server vagrant up sloopstash-dkr-mgr-1
$ VAGRANT_CWD=./vagrant/alma-linux-9/virtualbox/amd64/server vagrant up sloopstash-dkr-wkr-1
$ VAGRANT_CWD=./vagrant/alma-linux-9/virtualbox/amd64/server vagrant up sloopstash-dkr-wkr-2

